//- Software architecture: a web shop, its services and their data
diagram(dir="down")

  card#shopper.person(icon="user") Shopper
    to(web) HTTPS

  zone#shop.system Web shop
    card#web.app(icon="monitor") Storefront
      | React, served by the CDN
      to(api) JSON
    card#api.app(icon="server") API
      | Rust, 3 instances
      to(catalog orders)
    card#catalog.app Catalog service
      to(search)
    card#orders.app Orders service
      to(db) SQL
      to(queue).async order placed
      to(pay) charge
    card#search.store(icon="search") Search index
    card#db.store(icon="database") Orders DB
      | PostgreSQL
    card#queue.store Event bus

  card#pay.external(icon="credit-card") Payment provider
